╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║                    HYPRLAND KEYBINDS                        ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

MODIFIER
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER               Windows / Meta key


SCREENSHOTS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  PRINT               Select region → save to ~/Pictures/Captures
  SUPER + X           Screenshot active window
  SUPER + SHIFT + X   Select monitor → save to ~/Pictures/Captures


APPLICATIONS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER + Q           Open terminal (Kitty)
  SUPER + E           Open file manager (Yazi)
  SUPER + R           Toggle Quickshell launcher
  SUPER + SHIFT + B   Open Steam Big Picture
  SUPER + W           Randomize wallpaper
  SUPER + X           Restart Quickshell


WINDOW MANAGEMENT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER + C           Close active window
  SUPER + V           Toggle floating window
  SUPER + P           Toggle pseudo-tiling
  SUPER + J           Toggle split direction
  SUPER + M           Shutdown / exit Hyprland

  SUPER + ←           Focus window left
  SUPER + →           Focus window right
  SUPER + ↑           Focus window above
  SUPER + ↓           Focus window below

  SUPER + LMB         Move / drag window
  SUPER + RMB         Resize window


WORKSPACES
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER + 1-9         Switch to workspace 1-9
  SUPER + 0           Switch to workspace 10

  SUPER + SHIFT + 1-9
                      Move window to workspace 1-9

  SUPER + SHIFT + 0   Move window to workspace 10

  SUPER + S           Toggle "magic" scratchpad
  SUPER + SHIFT + S   Move window to "magic" scratchpad

  SUPER + SCROLL UP   Next workspace
  SUPER + SCROLL DOWN Previous workspace


AUDIO
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Volume Up           Increase volume 5%
  Volume Down         Decrease volume 5%
  Mute                Toggle speaker mute
  Mic Mute            Toggle microphone mute


BRIGHTNESS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Brightness Up       Increase brightness 5%
  Brightness Down     Decrease brightness 5%


MEDIA
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Next Track          Next song
  Previous Track      Previous song
  Play / Pause        Play / pause media


EXTRA
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUPER + F1          Toggle Game Mode

                      Game Mode OFF:
                        • Disables animations
                        • Removes gaps
                        • Removes borders
                        • Disables shadows
                        • Disables blur
                        • Removes window rounding

                      Press SUPER + F1 again to restore.


TOUCHPAD
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  3-Finger Swipe ←    Previous workspace
  3-Finger Swipe →    Next workspace


ALIASES
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GENERAL
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ll                  Detailed file listing
  binds               Show this keybind reference


GIT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  gs                  Git status
  ga                  Git add
  gc                  Git commit
  gp                  Git push
  gu                  Run gitupdate_safe


PACMAN
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  p                   Pacman
  pi                  Install package
  ps                  Search packages
  pu                  Update system
  pr                  Remove package
  pss                 List installed packages


YAY / AUR
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  y                   Yay
  yi                  Install package
  ys                  Search packages
  yu                  Update system + AUR
  yr                  Remove package
  yq                  Package information
  yout                Remove orphaned packages


DIRECTORIES
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  hd                  Go to home directory
  df                  Go to ~/.dotfiles
  la                  List files including hidden
  ll                  Detailed file listing
  lla                 Detailed listing including hidden
  cfg                 Go to ~/.config


OTHER
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  theme               Open Quickshell Main.qml in VSCodium

  ep                  Export installed package lists


PACKAGE EXPORT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ep

                      Creates:

                        ~/.dotfiles/packages/pacman.txt
                        ~/.dotfiles/packages/aur.txt
                        ~/.dotfiles/packages/all.txt

                      pacman.txt → Official repo packages
                      aur.txt    → AUR packages
                      all.txt    → Both combined


ZSH HISTORY
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  History File        ~/.zsh_history
  History Size        5000
  Saved History       5000 entries

  APPEND_HISTORY      Append history instead of overwriting
  SHARE_HISTORY       Share history between sessions
  HIST_IGNORE_DUPS    Ignore duplicate commands
  HIST_IGNORE_SPACE   Ignore commands beginning with a space
